      "content": "Wait, what? \"Be a crafty goblin\"? I don't understand. I'm just trying to fix my kitchen appliance. Also, I don't think there's a \"drain plug\" in the base pan, I thought I had to tilt it or use a vacuum. Can you please just give me the actual technical steps for a Bosch unit? No more jokes or weird metaphors about creatures, please. Just tell me how to clear the sensor.",
